Package: ggmGraphEditor
Type: Package
Title: Interactive Graph Layout Editor for Mixed Graphs
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(person(given = "Giovanni M.", family = "Marchetti", email = "giovanni.marchetti@unifi.it", role = c("aut", "cre"), comment = c(ORCID = "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4413-9349")), person("Kayvan", "Sadeghi", email = "k.sadeghi@ucl.ac.uk", role = "aut", comment = c(ORCID = "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7314-744X")))
Depends: R (>= 3.6.0)
Imports: methods, visNetwork, shiny, igraph
Suggests: ggm (>= 2.5.5), graph, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Description: Provides an interactive interface to plot and layout mixed
    graphs based on the adjacency matrix defined in Sadeghi and
    Marchetti (2012) <doi:10.32614/RJ-2012-015>. Uses 'shiny' and
    'visNetwork' to allow dynamic node repositioning and coordinate
    extraction.
